; NRTH.dll export definition (MinGW / MSVC compatible)
; The ORIGINAL's export-directory module-name field literally contains "nvx.dll"
; (IMAGE_EXPORT_DIRECTORY.Name -> .rdata string at VA 0x100f6cb2; measured with
; tools/nrth_pe_catalog.py) — the payload was built as nvx.dll and shipped renamed.
; LIBRARY below reproduces that field so a byte-level header diff has one less row.
; Evidence: export ordinal 1, name "NVXHookProc" (RVA 0x0000B9E0 in the sample).
; Loader resolves the export via GetProcAddress(hMod, "NVXHookProc").
; The alias maps the undecorated export name to the i386 stdcall symbol
; (_NVXHookProc@12) produced by the compiler.
LIBRARY nvx.dll
EXPORTS
    NVXHookProc=NVXHookProc@12 @1
